# Keep the Docker build context small.
#
# The frontend spike (web/frontend) has its own node_modules; without this the
# Docker build context balloons by hundreds of megabytes whenever it is present.
# None of it is needed to build or run the Go binary.

.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
web/frontend/node_modules
web/frontend/dist
**/*.log
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
tmp/
temp/
